{"seq":3,"slug":"runtime-scheduling-feedback","title":"量子计算运行时调度与实时反馈栈","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-frontier-research/quantum-computing-engineering/control-compilation-stack/runtime-scheduling-feedback","wordCount":2633,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"量子计算运行时调度与实时反馈栈\">量子计算运行时调度与实时反馈栈</h1><p>一个量子程序编译成脉冲序列之后，还远没到「能跑」的程度：谁在什么毫秒把这段波形送进稀释制冷机、测量结果在几百纳秒内能否回传并改变下一步操作、纠错解码器赶不赶得上下一个纠错周期——这些全部由**运行时（runtime）**决定。Google 在 Willow 上的 distance-7 表面码实验里，物理纠错周期只有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1.1</mn><mtext> </mtext><mi>μ</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1.1\\ \\mu s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.1</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span>，而配套的实时解码器平均要花 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>63</mn><mtext> </mtext><mi>μ</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">63\\ \\mu s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">63</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span>（Nature 638, 920–926，2024），两者相差近 60 倍。这个数字正是本文的核心张力：<strong>编译栈决定了「电路长什么样」，运行时栈决定了「它能不能按时被执行、按反馈被修正」</strong>。它是<a href=\"control-pulse-calibration\">控制脉冲与标定</a>与<a href=\"circuit-compilation-mapping\">线路编译与比特映射</a>之上、真正触碰时钟的第一层。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-三个时钟域\">核心概念：三个时钟域</h2><p>量子运行时不是一个调度器，而是三个互相耦合的时钟域叠加。**近时域（near-time）**由云端作业队列主导，时间尺度是秒到小时，决定一次作业排在哪个 QPU 上、能占用多久；<strong>实时域（real-time）<strong>由硬件定序器主导，时间尺度是纳秒到微秒，决定脉冲之间的相对时序；夹在中间的</strong>微秒域</strong>是纠错解码与条件反馈所在的区间，也是当前最容易断裂的一环。OpenQASM 3 规范（arXiv:2104.14722，ACM TQC 3(3)，2022）第一次在语言层面把「必须在量子比特相干时间内完成的实时经典计算」与不那么紧迫的近时计算区分开，正是这三个时钟域的抽象化。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;近时域&lt;br/&gt;云端作业队列 / Session / Batch&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;作业调度&lt;br/&gt;配额 + 拓扑感知放置&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;实时控序列化&lt;br/&gt;OpenQASM 3 → QIR → 机器码&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;定序器调度&lt;br/&gt;通道 + 触发 + 时隙&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E[&quot;AWG 输出&lt;br/&gt;ns 级脉冲&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; F[&quot;量子比特 + 读出&lt;br/&gt;1-2 μs 测量&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt; G[&quot;实时解码器&lt;br/&gt;syndrome → 修正&quot;]&#10;    G --&gt;|&quot;反馈条件门&lt;br/&gt;几十 ns-几 μs&quot;| D&#10;    F --&gt; H[&quot;原始测量流&lt;br/&gt;回传 / 归档&quot;]&#10;    H --&gt; A\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"近时域&lt;br/&gt;云端作业队列 / Session / Batch\"] --&gt; B[\"作业调度&lt;br/&gt;配额 + 拓扑感知放置\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"实时控序列化&lt;br/&gt;OpenQASM 3 → QIR → 机器码\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"定序器调度&lt;br/&gt;通道 + 触发 + 时隙\"]\n    D --&gt; E[\"AWG 输出&lt;br/&gt;ns 级脉冲\"]\n    E --&gt; F[\"量子比特 + 读出&lt;br/&gt;1-2 μs 测量\"]\n    F --&gt; G[\"实时解码器&lt;br/&gt;syndrome → 修正\"]\n    G --&gt;|\"反馈条件门&lt;br/&gt;几十 ns-几 μs\"| D\n    F --&gt; H[\"原始测量流&lt;br/&gt;回传 / 归档\"]\n    H --&gt; A</pre><p>三层各自的产物流向与时间尺度：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>时钟域</th>\n<th>决策主体</th>\n<th>时间尺度</th>\n<th>典型产物</th>\n<th>失败模式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>近时域</td>\n<td>云端调度器</td>\n<td>秒–小时</td>\n<td>作业优先级、实例配额</td>\n<td>排队抖动、QPU 空转</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>微秒域</td>\n<td>解码器 + 控制主机</td>\n<td>0.1–100 μs</td>\n<td>纠错修正、条件触发</td>\n<td>解码器跟不上周期</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实时域</td>\n<td>FPGA 定序器</td>\n<td>0.1 ns–100 ns</td>\n<td>脉冲触发、相位更新</td>\n<td>时序冲突、通道串扰</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>一句话定位</strong>：近时域决定「有没有机器用」，实时域决定「脉冲准不准」，微秒域决定「错误能不能被当场修正」。三者用同一套硬件资源，却由完全不同的调度策略管理——这正是运行时栈难做的根源。</p>\n<h2 id=\"延迟预算-反馈环到底要跑多快\">延迟预算：反馈环到底要跑多快</h2><p>实时反馈栈能不能成立，取决于一条不等式。设纠错周期为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>y</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{cyc}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">cy</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，一次完整的「测量→解码→反馈门」必须落在同一个或少数几个周期内：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>y</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub><mtext>  </mtext><mo>≥</mo><mtext>  </mtext><msub><mi>τ</mi><mtext>meas</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mtext>decode</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mtext>rt</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{cyc} \\;\\ge\\; \\tau_{\\text{meas}} + \\tau_{\\text{decode}} + \\tau_{\\text{rt}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">cy</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1132em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">meas</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1132em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">decode</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1132em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">rt</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>τ</mi><mtext>meas</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau_{\\text{meas}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1132em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">meas</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是读出时间，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>τ</mi><mtext>decode</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau_{\\text{decode}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1132em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">decode</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是解码时间，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>τ</mi><mtext>rt</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau_{\\text{rt}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1132em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">rt</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是经典回传与条件门触发时间。以 Willow 的 number 为例：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>y</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1.1</mn><mtext> </mtext><mi>μ</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{cyc} = 1.1\\ \\mu s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">cy</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.1</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span>，读出（色散测量，见<a href=\"control-pulse-calibration\">脉冲与标定</a>）约占 300–800 ns，留给解码与反馈的窗口只剩几百纳秒。而该实验的流式解码器平均延迟是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>63</mn><mtext> </mtext><mi>μ</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">63\\ \\mu s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">63</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span>，<strong>比周期大了近两个数量级</strong>——这意味着在 distance-7 memory 实验中，修正实际上是「事后」施加的，解码器异步消费测量流，而不是卡在反馈环里。这是理解当下所有「实时纠错」宣传的一把钥匙：<em>memory 实验可以在环外解码，逻辑门实验不行</em>。</p>\n<p>当解码延迟大于周期时，系统必须靠**缓冲（buffering）**撑住：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mtext>  </mtext><mo>≥</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">⌈</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>τ</mi><mtext>decode</mtext></msub><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>y</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">⌉</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B \\;\\ge\\; \\left\\lceil \\frac{\\tau_{\\text{decode}}}{T_{cyc}} \\right\\rceil</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8193em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4221em;vertical-align:-0.9721em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">⌈</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">cy</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1132em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">decode</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9721em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">⌉</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span> 是为了不让解码成为瓶颈而必须在环内缓存的周期数。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span> 越大，同一物理错误在缓冲窗口内累积的相关性越强，解码难度也随之上升——这是延迟与精度之间的直接权衡。工程上压缩 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>y</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{cyc}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">cy</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（更快读出、更短门）与压缩 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>τ</mi><mtext>decode</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau_{\\text{decode}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1132em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">decode</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（更快算法、专用硬件）是两条同时推进的战线。</p>\n<h2 id=\"解码器-反馈环的算法核心\">解码器：反馈环的算法核心</h2><p>解码器的任务是把每轮 syndrome 测量得到的错误图样映射成一个修正操作，复杂度直接决定 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>τ</mi><mtext>decode</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau_{\\text{decode}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1132em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">decode</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。主流算法分三代：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>解码算法</th>\n<th>复杂度 / 速度</th>\n<th>关键优势</th>\n<th>实时性现状</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>MWPM（最小权完美匹配）</td>\n<td>多项式，PyMatching 比 NetworkX/Blossom V 快「数个数量级」（arXiv:2105.13082）</td>\n<td>精度基准</td>\n<td>通用求解器太慢，需局部化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Union-Find</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>α</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n\\,\\alpha(n))</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span></span></span></span></span>，近乎线性（arXiv:1709.06218，Quantum 5, 595）</td>\n<td>复杂度低、易硬件化</td>\n<td>硬件解码器主力</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>机器学习（AlphaQubit）</td>\n<td>推理需 GPU/专用加速</td>\n<td>比 correlated matching 少 30% 错误（Nature，2024-11）</td>\n<td><strong>尚未达到超导 1 MHz 检查率</strong></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Delfosse–Nickerson 的 Union-Find 解码器是硬件化的分水岭：它的最坏复杂度是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>α</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n\\,\\alpha(n))</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span></span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 为反 Ackermann 函数，实际 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≤</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\le 3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span>），在理想测量下对 2D toric code 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>9.9</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">9.9\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">9.9%</span></span></span></span></span> 的阈值、带测量噪声时 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2.6</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2.6\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.6%</span></span></span></span></span>（arXiv:1709.06218）。近乎线性的复杂度意味着解码时间随码距近似线性增长，这在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 从 7 涨到 15、21 时是唯一可持续的路线——MWPM 的通用求解器会先撑不住。</p>\n<p>Google DeepMind 的 <strong>AlphaQubit</strong> 代表了另一条路线：用 Transformer 从 syndrome 序列直接学出修正，在 Sycamore 最大规模实验中比 correlated matching 少犯 30% 的错误、比 tensor network 方法少 6%，训练用 25 轮、推理在仿真中跑到 10 万轮仍保持性能（Google DeepMind，2024-11-20，Nature）。但官方明确指出它<strong>还不够快</strong>，超导处理器的检查率约每秒一百万次——这恰好把「精度」与「吞吐」的取舍摆到台面上：ML 解码器赢在精度，输在延迟，短期内更适合作为离线校准与「慢环」优化器，而非环内主解码器。</p>\n<h2 id=\"硬件定序与近时调度\">硬件定序与近时调度</h2><p>微秒域以下，一切归 FPGA 定序器管辖。现代控制栈（Qblox Cluster、Zurich Instruments SHF、Keysight 系统等）内置<strong>数控振荡器（NCO）与定序器</strong>，把「第几个时隙触发哪条通道、相位更新多少个弧度」编译成定序器微码；通道间的触发同步精度直接决定双比特门的条件相位能否对齐。这一层与<a href=\"control-pulse-calibration\">脉冲标定</a>共享同一份参数表：标定写进去的幅度、相位、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span>，最终由定序器在运行时读出并套用。</p>\n<p>往环内再压一层延迟，需要<strong>条件反馈（feed-forward）</strong>：一次测量结果决定后续门是否施加。实验上已验证的原则是——带反馈的扇出控制在超过 25 个输出比特时才优于无反馈方案，若经典反馈延迟可忽略则门槛降到 17 个（arXiv:2409.06989）；当前实验演示仍停留在 4 个输出比特。这条「扇出规模」曲线说明反馈的收益不是线性的：反馈延迟每增加一点，就吞掉一部分本可用于并行控制的时钟预算。</p>\n<p>近时域则回到经典分布式调度。IBM Quantum System Two 明确把「经典运行时服务器（classical runtime servers）支撑混合工作流」写进架构（IBM Quantum Roadmap 2025），作业层面的配额、Session 与 Batch 模式决定了同一 QPU 上并行作业的隔离粒度。当解码与条件反馈变成常态，调度器还多了一项约束：<strong>纠错解码任务必须与量子作业在时间上对齐</strong>，否则解码器会在 QPU 空闲时满负荷、在作业高峰时被抢占。把解码器视作独立的实时微服务、给它保留 CPU/FPGA 核、与 QPU 时钟做硬同步，是 2025–2026 年各家的通行做法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"断裂点-三个还没闭合的环\">断裂点：三个还没闭合的环</h2><p><strong>其一，解码延迟与周期的鸿沟。</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>63</mn><mtext> </mtext><mi>μ</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">63\\ \\mu s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">63</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1.1</mn><mtext> </mtext><mi>μ</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1.1\\ \\mu s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.1</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span> 的差距不是靠堆硬件就能抹平的，需要更快的算法（Union-Find 硬件化）与更短的周期同时推进。Riverlane 等厂商以专用解码 ASIC（Deltaflow 系列）作为方向，把 Union-Find/MWPM 变体固化到芯片上，是当前最直接的工程答案。</p>\n<p><strong>其二，稀有相关错误。</strong> Google 的重复码实验跑到 distance-29 时，性能被「每小时约一次」的高能宇宙射线事件限制（Nature 638, 2024，约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>9</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3\\times10^9</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">9</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 周期一次）。这类事件在时间上相关、在空间上成片，破坏了解码器「错误独立」的假设，必须靠<strong>跨周期相关性建模</strong>（correlated matching）与硬件探测器（如同步的宇宙射线监测）配合——这已超出纯算法范畴，是运行时栈与探测器系统的联合工程。</p>\n<p><strong>其三，新码型的互联需求。</strong> IBM 的 qLDPC 路线要求比特间存在<strong>长程连接</strong>（L-couplers 微波链路），其 2029 年的 Starling 系统目标是「200 个逻辑比特上跑 1 亿个门」（IBM Quantum Roadmap 2025）。长程连接把「调度」从局部耦合图的近邻路由，升级为跨模块、跨芯片的全局时序协调——这一层目前还没有成熟的开源运行时实现，是未来三年最可能被重构的部分。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>量子运行时由<strong>三个时钟域</strong>叠加构成：近时域（秒–小时，作业调度）、微秒域（解码与反馈）、实时域（ns 级脉冲定序），三者共享硬件却策略迥异。</li>\n<li>反馈能否成立由延迟预算决定：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>y</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≥</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mtext>meas</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mtext>decode</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mtext>rt</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{cyc} \\ge \\tau_{\\text{meas}} + \\tau_{\\text{decode}} + \\tau_{\\text{rt}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">cy</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1132em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">meas</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1132em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">decode</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1132em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">rt</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>；当解码慢于周期时必须靠缓冲 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>≥</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌈</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mtext>decode</mtext></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>y</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌉</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B \\ge \\lceil \\tau_{\\text{decode}}/T_{cyc} \\rceil</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8193em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⌈</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1132em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">decode</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">cy</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">⌉</span></span></span></span></span> 撑住，代价是相关性上升。</li>\n<li>Willow 的实测张力是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>63</mn><mtext> </mtext><mi>μ</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">63\\ \\mu s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">63</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span> 解码对 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1.1</mn><mtext> </mtext><mi>μ</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1.1\\ \\mu s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.1</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span> 周期——<strong>memory 实验可在环外异步解码，逻辑门实验不行</strong>，这是判断「真实时」与否的分界线。</li>\n<li>解码器三代并存：MWPM（精度基准）、Union-Find（近线性 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>α</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n\\,\\alpha(n))</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span></span></span></span></span>、硬件主力）、ML（AlphaQubit 精度最优但未达 1 MHz 检查率）；实时场景当前仍以硬件化 Union-Find 为主。</li>\n<li>条件反馈的收益非线性：带反馈扇出超过约 25 个输出比特才优于无反馈方案（arXiv:2409.06989），反馈延迟直接吃掉并行控制的时钟预算。</li>\n<li>三个未闭合的环——解码延迟鸿沟、每小时一次的宇宙射线相关错误、qLDPC 长程互联的全局调度——共同定义了运行时栈未来三年的工程主线。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"量子计算运行时调度与实时反馈栈","id":"量子计算运行时调度与实时反馈栈"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：三个时钟域","id":"核心概念-三个时钟域"},{"level":2,"text":"延迟预算：反馈环到底要跑多快","id":"延迟预算-反馈环到底要跑多快"},{"level":2,"text":"解码器：反馈环的算法核心","id":"解码器-反馈环的算法核心"},{"level":2,"text":"硬件定序与近时调度","id":"硬件定序与近时调度"},{"level":2,"text":"断裂点：三个还没闭合的环","id":"断裂点-三个还没闭合的环"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"量子线路编译、转译与比特映射","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-frontier-research/quantum-computing-engineering/control-compilation-stack/circuit-compilation-mapping"},"next":{"title":"噪声模型与错误表征方法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-frontier-research/quantum-computing-engineering/error-correction-fault-tolerance/noise-error-characterization"}}